{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds after the events of the previous title. A new dynasty rises from the ashes of war, while old grudges and fresh rivalries spread through a tangled web of factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a spirited young man from a well-off family, unwilling to be confined to the study. Driven by a thirst for freedom, you step into the ever-shifting jianghu, beginning a journey that is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/2c0bfc69c9f360fe5b4d673f15c276f7.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no fixed \u201chero\u2019s path\u201d here. Will you uphold justice as a righteous hero, or roam freely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as a carefree wanderer? Every choice shapes not only your own survival, but also the fate of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >others, and perhaps the destiny of the jianghu itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/509847fa1b983e4130f4360b62208a3e.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/509847fa1b983e4130f4360b62208a3e.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/509847fa1b983e4130f4360b62208a3e.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/d5c8de95bd7a5e683990cb2c1e80d3d4.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based combat returns, now enhanced with features like <strong>Shield Break Combos</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and <strong>Team Skills</strong>, blending an easy-to-pick-up flow with the layered tactics of a chess match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/5f612e9ee31d0f16759a8bfb7a1a90ec.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/5f612e9ee31d0f16759a8bfb7a1a90ec.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/5f612e9ee31d0f16759a8bfb7a1a90ec.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/eedea777f2fca16fa95760ba9f43e15f.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds with companions of diverse backgrounds and temperaments. Each carries their</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >own secrets, ambitions, and signature techniques, and may tip the balance when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e4add4678198a34287c08b2dc7026130.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e4add4678198a34287c08b2dc7026130.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e4add4678198a34287c08b2dc7026130.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e666c9d3f644c748a2d272d3d00ff3a5.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic-style illustrations breathe life into a pixelated world, enriched with dynamic lighting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and particle effects to portray both the thrill of combat and the everyday warmth of the jianghu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/9be0431e8080379eae58c810b2fa3723.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/9be0431e8080379eae58c810b2fa3723.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/9be0431e8080379eae58c810b2fa3723.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956640?t=1758088378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/ab89197ad3b88750d5b536b86663561ec492d81b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758088378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/5cc0723a373e4aec401c1ebd7a6ec6a3d06ad94d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758088378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/5cc0723a373e4aec401c1ebd7a6ec6a3d06ad94d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758088378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Join Our Community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u00a0host\u00a0community\u00a0events,\u00a0and\u00a0share\u00a0upcoming\u00a0playtests\u00a0and\u00a0updates\u00a0in\u00a0our\u00a0official\u00a0Discord\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >channel.\u00a0Join\u00a0now\u00a0to\u00a0be\u00a0the\u00a0first\u00a0to\u00a0get\u00a0notified!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds after the events of the previous title. A new dynasty rises from the ashes of war, while old grudges and fresh rivalries spread through a tangled web of factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a spirited young man from a well-off family, unwilling to be confined to the study. Driven by a thirst for freedom, you step into the ever-shifting jianghu, beginning a journey that is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/2c0bfc69c9f360fe5b4d673f15c276f7.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no fixed \u201chero\u2019s path\u201d here. Will you uphold justice as a righteous hero, or roam freely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as a carefree wanderer? Every choice shapes not only your own survival, but also the fate of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >others, and perhaps the destiny of the jianghu itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/509847fa1b983e4130f4360b62208a3e.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/509847fa1b983e4130f4360b62208a3e.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/509847fa1b983e4130f4360b62208a3e.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/d5c8de95bd7a5e683990cb2c1e80d3d4.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based combat returns, now enhanced with features like <strong>Shield Break Combos</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and <strong>Team Skills</strong>, blending an easy-to-pick-up flow with the layered tactics of a chess match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/5f612e9ee31d0f16759a8bfb7a1a90ec.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/5f612e9ee31d0f16759a8bfb7a1a90ec.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/5f612e9ee31d0f16759a8bfb7a1a90ec.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/eedea777f2fca16fa95760ba9f43e15f.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds with companions of diverse backgrounds and temperaments. Each carries their</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >own secrets, ambitions, and signature techniques, and may tip the balance when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e4add4678198a34287c08b2dc7026130.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e4add4678198a34287c08b2dc7026130.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e4add4678198a34287c08b2dc7026130.mp4?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/e666c9d3f644c748a2d272d3d00ff3a5.avif?t=1758088378\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic-style illustrations breathe life into a pixelated world, enriched with dynamic lighting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and particle effects to portray both the thrill of combat and the everyday warmth of the jianghu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/9be0431e8080379eae58c810b2fa3723.poster.avif?t=1758088378\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956640/extras/9be0431e8080379eae58c810b2fa3723.webm?t=1758088378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: